    "title" : "The EVP Problem",
    "description" : "<p>Your Employee Value Proposition (EVP) is the promise you make about opportunity and culture. Most organizations either don't have one, haven't deployed it externally, or have one that hasn't been pressure-tested for truth and relevance. MarketDesign closes that gap.</p>",
